1
00:00:00,476 --> 00:00:01,516
[DOOR SLAMS]

2
00:00:03,312 --> 00:00:04,812
(Mrs Cooper:)You don't hunt, do you?

3
00:00:09,318 --> 00:00:10,648
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

4
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:14,530
(Mrs Cooper(entering):)Good morning, Snickerdoodle.

5
00:00:14,699 --> 00:00:15,909
(Mrs Cooper(entering):)- Morning.
- Oh.

6
00:00:16,075 --> 00:00:18,615
(Mrs Cooper:)Well, that looks awful fancy.
What is that?

7
00:00:20,079 --> 00:00:25,329
(Sheldon:)It's my idea of what DNA would look like
in a silicon-based life form.

8
00:00:25,876 --> 00:00:30,176
(Mrs Cooper:)But intelligently designed
by a creator, right?

9
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:33,263
(Sheldon:)What do you want, Mom?

10
00:00:33,676 --> 00:00:37,636
(Mrs Cooper:)You know how your daddy used to say
that you can only fish for so long...

11
00:00:37,805 --> 00:00:40,685
...before you gotta throw
a stick of dynamite in the water?

12
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:43,980
- Yeah?
- Well, I'm done fishing.

13
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:47,610
- You put those on.
- What for?

14
00:00:47,773 --> 00:00:49,653
Because you're gonna go
to your office...

15
00:00:49,817 --> 00:00:52,357
...apologize to your boss
and get your job back.

16
00:00:52,528 --> 00:00:54,018
(Sheldon:)- No.
- I'm sorry.

